    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Server!</h1><p></p><br><h1>Steam Workshop</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Workshop</h2>You can make your own map with the Map Editor.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1380230/extras/c49b61567e4f94b52d5f91dfef45f757.avif?t=1704657257\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Monocity</h2><br>Monocity is a multiplayer real estate board game.<br>The game supports up to 20 players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>In each round: All players roll the dice together and move. The player who bids the highest price gets the land.<br>Collect resources, build buildings, upgrade them, increase population, use cards, trade with players, and more. <br>Make other players go bankrupt.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content</h2>(Dec 2023)<br><br>2 maps<br>11 types of land<br>2 types of resource<br>7 unique buildings<br>13 cards<br>AI Player<br>Map Editor<br>&amp; more updates",
